1785609437520670	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEyuAc		item.comment	bn-3e4l	{"body":"Landed. Lead ran all 12 crate suites in-workspace (136 green — the predicted lib.rs conflict merged cleanly). Ratified: the three-part dependency finding (forward forbidden by rule; normal-reverse declined on docs/03 §8 certificate-decoding diversity though unforbidden; dev-reverse admitted by the checker's own stated rationale, with the forced tcb_class=dev-only edge annotation accepted as describing the EDGE); ClosedSet::of as the signature-level restatement of the closed() seam; no-import byte emission from the documented grammar; the deliberate non-claim on full-certificate sweeps (a widened hi bound still verifies — that IS what envelope-digest-binding being trusted means, and asserting it is the honest move). The fourth frozen TV-009 fact is now asserted: engine-emitted certificate independently Verified (16 states, 96 transitions). DEL-07 NOT annotated — IMPL-03 checking remains; label moved to bn-3e0m. State-type-family emission (~10 lines) recorded as follow-up if wanted."}	blake3:XH3C7C1fBvsX_FVa34VskJMHynOuvJUkufcAo8Z6cKc
