1785610673316789	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEywAc		item.comment	bn-30eym	{"body":"Landed @ 7beb15f. Lead ran the value suites in-workspace (132 green incl. published-vector pins and the diffusion smoke test) and full workspace green. Ratified: the pure-feature reasoning (digests never a function of host cc — the supply-chain argument done right); TCB class trusted-checking-base with the containment argument stated-not-used-to-discount; placeholder retained as the seam's proof of openness; the declared-after-Blake3 collider test proving nothing hardcoded the vendor. T02 is now FULLY delivered: extractor taught the delivered convention for heading categories, docs/09 T02 annotated (bn-277, bn-2res, bn-30eym). The four stale no-external-dependency prose sites fixed trunk-direct with gov-1 evidence regenerated."}	blake3:eLi3I7QWIbO5Z7vwCychgQasfxxDL1aRktZf-RHiN7g
