1785619326538952	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEyggg		item.create	bn-1mhcr	{"description":"# Context\nFrom bn-i4aem/bn-3bhkp: the canonical JSON codec + 6 golden vectors landed; RFC 0026 requires a second encoding (canonical_cbor) with IDENTICAL field order (NOT the CBOR spec's length-first map ordering — the decision is recorded in the IDL encoding section) and the conforming-daemon golden set across all operations is owed.\n# Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] canonical_cbor encode/decode mirroring the JSON rules (same field order, same presence discipline, same reader-side rejections); round-trip + cross-encoding identity tests (same message, both encodings, one canonical field sequence).\n- [ ] Golden vectors extended to a representative set per namespace, both encodings.\n- [ ] Mutation sweeps for the CBOR reader per the JSON precedent.\n- [ ] just check green.","kind":"task","title":"canonical_cbor encoding and the full golden-vector set"}	blake3:HCKynf0I-hN85ZBrmJa1x1oYTyu1mSvTmNldSP4ClfQ
