1785694690202380	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEysQg		item.comment	bn-1gc	{"body":"Landed @ 3f56987df0ae. Lead re-verified post-sync in-workspace: 131 continuum-task tests green (77 pre-existing unchanged + 54 new), fmt/clippy clean, dossier validator pass, region.rs/region/ zero diff vs epoch.\n\nRATIFIED. (1) The omission discipline's strong form — a charge against a declared+unmetered dimension is REFUSED, not recorded — because recording spend nothing measured invents a measurement RFC 0026 requires absent; this is the INV-007 reading and MeterSet::STATES_ONLY deriving continuumd's eight omissions makes the daemon's current behavior a theorem instead of an array. (2) The committed-spend reading in task.update_budget: recorded non-refundable spend, NOT spend-at-last-checkpoint — the alternative admits a ceiling the run has already passed, i.e. retroactive truncation, which is exactly what B18's park exists to prevent. Normative; pinned by lowering_between_the_checkpoint_and_the_live_spend_still_parks. (3) Exhaustion-as-result never error/verdict, first-tripped-dimension memory, settle-returns-refund (unreachable arm worse than no arm). (4) EvidenceBook::reconcile as a THIRD independent accounting rather than a second obligation ledger — agreement stays evidence, not tautology.\n\nCONCERN DISPOSITIONS. CostDimension's home: deferred as a pure relocation to continuum-value if/when a second crate needs the nine — continuumd deliberately agrees by shared token (the WorkerState::status_token device), so the rewiring bone does not force the move. Suspension-across-teardown: consistent with bn-12t's ratified parked-continuation resolution (continuation is the durable artifact, region finalizes, resume mints fresh in a strictly-later region); constraint restated on the successor so it is not re-litigated.\n\nIMPL-02 DECLINE ACCEPTED. Both acceptance criteria route to bn-23j7s (continuumd budget rewiring, created, carries req:pr-6-impl-02, blocks bn-1n6r and bn-2ofd): criterion 1 (BudgetExhausted carries continuation or typed non_resumable_reason) is satisfied at the calculus level by the Suspend arm's B18 park but the wire surface was outside this fence; criterion 2 (durability across restart) needs artifact identity neither ledger can name — the daemon's join, coordinating with bn-3dr's restart machinery. PR-6 now IMPL-01/03/04/05/06 satisfied; IMPL-02 is the open bullet and has an active carrier."}	blake3:7jfQdWU2WVk01i8ZvtW3HkZd4QrFjzOlOrpGQwHkkTg
