1785867111469119	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEyqwo		item.comment	bn-6ekf7	{"body":"Lead: both dispositions ratified and merged @ epoch f6c3247. Reading 1: omissions[].kind = closed SelectionKind vocabulary — the exactness-of-partition sentences in both schema and RFC 0028 are undecidable over free prose, and the code already implemented the reading; example fixed (correction 16), shape change (string→enum) correctly withheld and recorded as RFC 0028 F13 for the schema sweep, mirroring the F5/correction-2 precedent for expansions[].relation. Reading 2: content_budget.bytes = measured post-packing size (correction 17) — the FR-01 summing argument is decisive (summing a fixed ceiling can never show a reduction; the metric would be uncomputable), reinforced by the schema's own nodes-vs-bytes asymmetry and the Cost-not-Budget provenance tie. Interim-placeholder honesty noted: real byte packing is PR-11/IMPL-06's bullet, and daemon/context.rs needs the same fix when it lands — BOTH recorded for the IMPL-06 brief. 73 continuum-context tests green."}	blake3:jCtSIv26-h2GWQQ1otOp7U6ajYgDAssL34u7iD1_Xlk
