1785869896107010	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEyxQo		item.comment	bn-3vxp	{"body":"Lead: reviewed and merged @ epoch a59a9a9. Ratifications: (1) faults as pure set-membership never emitting non-affirmatives — membership is always decidable, correct. (2) fairness two-pass with the conservative fallback (clean weak<->strong swap → single Strengthened/Weakened record; condition-also-moved → removed+added, never affirmative) ACCEPTED as interim; the RFC ambiguity it papers over is routed to bn-1fik9 for a text disposition rather than left implicit. (3) assurance as thin projection over assurance_policy::change_to bridged by wire-token spelling — one authority, one production dep edge, exactly the instruction. (4) The admits_relation-over-admits-Incomparable-on-assurance divergence vs correction 13 is a REAL catch, pinned live; fix routed to bn-2sngz (falsification-discipline shape: flip pin to regression guard). 111 semantic-diff tests green. PR-12-IMPL-06 bullet annotated at close."}	blake3:SMhVfW5T6KvXOGAB0oQMhTIdwUT3oToMOdzr0_eYgoY
